SUMMARY:Fjord Drama - Winner Cannes Film Festival + Dinner (Cineplex Varsi
 ty )
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\nNote: Once theatres update their movie lis
 ting\, latest Wednesday that week\, the time and location will be confirme
 d.\n\nOn **Saturday October 24th\,** join me to see **Fjord\, Winner of th
 e prestigious Palme d’Or at this year’s Cannes Film Festival**. The la
 test film from writer-director Cristian Mungiu is a gripping high-stakes c
 ourtroom drama driven by a profound moral dilemma\, where private lives ar
 e laid bare for public scrutiny. In the latest from masterful Cristian Mun
 giu (*Graduation\,* TIFF ’16\; *R.M.N*\, TIFF ’22)\, Lisbet (Renate Re
 insve\, TIFF ’25’s*Sentimental Value*) and Mihai Gheorghiu (Sebastian 
 Stan\, TIFF ’23’s *Dumb Money*) are a conservative Christian couple wh
 o’ve relocated from Romania to an isolated Norwegian town with their fiv
 e children. Unlike their new neighbours\, the Gheorghius enforce daily bib
 le study and don’t allow trappings like smartphones and YouTube. The fam
 ily’s rigid beliefs cause a stir when one of the children is accused of 
 introducing religious bias into their school by criticizing another studen
 t’s sexual orientation. This\, however\, is just the beginning of the fa
 mily’s problems.... **My seat is J13. Purchase your tickets for Fjord on
  Saturday October 24th for the Regular Show at 6:45pm at Cineplex Varsity.
 **\n\n**COST**\nRegular $16.80/ Cineclub $10.99 + taxes\n\n**SIGNING UP**\
 n\n* **Simply RSVP Yes confirming Yes/No to food/drinks prior**\n* **Purch
 ase your own ticket by selecting Get Tickets\, Saturday October 24th\, Cin
 eplex Varsity Regular Show at 6:45pm\, and post your seat number as a Comm
 ent**\n* You can also meet the group at the meetup time with your ticket i
 n hand\n* RSVPs close 1 day prior\n\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me for dinner
  prior at: 5pm at Scaccia inside the Manulife Building** at 55 Bloor St. W
 . on the Concourse level. Please wait for me to get there before getting s
 eated\, as I have requested a specific table.\n\n**Meet me at: 6:35pm in f
 ront of Auditorium 7\, inside Cineplex Varsity within the Maulife Building
  at 55 Bloor St. W. after scanning your ticket**\n\n**Show starts**: 6:45p
 m\n\nLength: 2 hours 26 minutes\n\nAfter: meet me outside **Auditorium 7**
  to walk over to the VIP Restaurant to chat about the movie.\n\nEnjoy and 
 please post your comments in the event after.
