SUMMARY:Virtual Register: Travel Trends 2027 Explained
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\n**Note: In addition to RSVPing Yes\, you w
 ill also need to register below for your link to the event.**\n\nOn **Tues
 day\, October 27th\,** **join Travel Trends 2027 Explained.** Learn from t
 ravel experts about where you should consider going next\, how to plan and
  execute the perfect trip\, and ways to unlock the possibilities of dream 
 destinations and bucket list journeys.\n\nFeaturing **Antonia Whyatt\,** a
  travel and lifestyle journalist and magazine editor who currently oversee
 s *Mapped*\, Zoomer’s digital travel hub\, **Kellee Irwin\,** Vice Presi
 dent at Orion Travel Insurance Company\, a Toronto-based subsidiary of the
  CAA Club Group\, and **Pattie Lovett-Reid**\, a certified financial plann
 er and Chief Financial Commentator at HomeEquity Bank. **Christine Cardoso
 **\, a Toronto radio and news personality who currently can be heard on Th
 e Afternoon Express on Zoomer Radio\, is the event host. **Please register
  for Travel Trends 2027 Explained on Tuesday\, October 27th.**\n\n**COST**
 \nFree\n\n**SIGNING UP**\n\n* Simply RSVP Yes\n* **[Register](https://www.
 eventbrite.ca/e/travel-trends-2027-explained-online-audience-tickets-20022
 94902955?utm_source=Zoomer-Promotions&utm_medium=Email&utm_campaign=ZOOMER
 261014005_20261015)** for your link to the event. You will receive a confi
 rmation email. A few minutes before start time\, click on the link in your
  email\, sign in to your Eventbrite account\, scroll down and click on the
  Join Now button\,\n* **Start time: 12 noon**\n* Length: 1 hour\n*\n* RSVP
 s close 2 days before\n\nEnjoy and please post your Comments after!
