SUMMARY:Bee Gees and The Beach Boys - Uncovered 20th Anniversary + Pre-Din
 ner
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\n**On Wednesday November 11th\, join me for
  the 20th Annual Uncovered with the Music of the Bee Gees and The Beach Bo
 ys.** This milestone celebration brings together the sun-soaked harmonies 
 of the Beach Boys and the falsetto-fuelled disco brilliance of the Bee Gee
 s\, reimagined through UnCovered's signature blend of theatrical storytell
 ing and world-class musicianship. My seat is Lower Balcony A13. **Purchase
  your ticket to Musical Stage Company presents UnCovered: Bee Gees & The B
 each Boys on Wednesday November 11th at 8pm.**\n\n**COST**\n$59 - $120 + s
 ervice fee.\n\nTicket Policy: All sales are final\, no refunds or exchange
 s.\n\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n* **RSVP Yes (everyone goes on the waitlist until 
 they post their seat number)\, confirming if you will join for dinner prio
 r**\n* **[Purchase](https://www.rcmusic.com/tickets/seats/468601)**[ ](htt
 ps://tickets.mirvish.com/tina/20416)**your own ticket\, post a comment wit
 h your seat number and I will move you to going**.\n\nA reminder will be s
 ent the day before with my cell and reminder details where to meet and whe
 n.\n\nRSVPs close 2 days prior and the Waitlist will be removed at that ti
 me. Cancellations will result in a No Show and impact future attendance.\n
 \n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me for dinner at: 6:15pm at Proof Bar & Patio\, 
 220 Bloor St. W.**\n\n**Meet me for the concert at: 7:45pm inside Koerner 
 Hall at 273 Bloor St.\, to the left side along the glass wall after enteri
 ng the double glass doors**\n\n**Start**: 8pm\n\nLength: 2 hours\n\nEnjoy 
 and please post your comments in the Event after.
